---
import './design-aids.css';
import SketchSheet from './SketchSheet.astro';
import SketchArrow from './SketchArrow.astro';
---
<figure id="constraint-deletion" class="design-aid design-figure paper-surface constraint-deletion wide" aria-labelledby="constraint-deletion-title">
  <span class="plate-number">Illustration · Deleting referenced records</span>
  <h3 id="constraint-deletion-title">Which records remain?</h3>
  <p>Each attempt starts with order O12, its first line and product P7 present. The line refers to both the order and the product.</p>
  <section class="delete-case" aria-labelledby="restrict-attempt">
    <h4 id="restrict-attempt">Attempt 1: delete product P7</h4>
    <p class="outcome"><code>ON DELETE RESTRICT</code> refuses the deletion because the line still refers to P7.</p>
    <div class="record-row">
      <SketchSheet>
        <div class="record"><p class="table-name">orders</p><strong class="identity">O12</strong><span class="state">Kept</span></div>
      </SketchSheet>
      <div class="connection reference-left"><SketchArrow /><span>references</span></div>
      <SketchSheet>
        <div class="record"><p class="table-name">order_lines</p><strong class="identity">O12 · line 1</strong><dl><div><dt>order_id</dt><dd>O12</dd></div><div><dt>product_id</dt><dd>P7</dd></div></dl><span class="state">Kept</span></div>
      </SketchSheet>
      <div class="connection reference-right"><SketchArrow /><span>references</span></div>
      <SketchSheet tone="amber">
        <div class="record"><p class="table-name">products</p><strong class="identity">P7</strong><span class="state">Kept · deletion refused</span></div>
      </SketchSheet>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="delete-case" aria-labelledby="cascade-attempt">
    <h4 id="cascade-attempt">Attempt 2: delete order O12</h4>
    <p class="outcome"><code>ON DELETE CASCADE</code> removes the order and its line. Product P7 remains in the catalogue.</p>
    <div class="record-row">
      <SketchSheet tone="amber">
        <div class="record removed"><p class="table-name">orders</p><strong class="identity">O12</strong><span class="state">Deleted by the request</span></div>
      </SketchSheet>
      <div class="connection cascade"><SketchArrow /><span>CASCADE</span></div>
      <SketchSheet tone="amber">
        <div class="record removed"><p class="table-name">order_lines</p><strong class="identity">O12 · line 1</strong><dl><div><dt>order_id</dt><dd>O12</dd></div><div><dt>product_id</dt><dd>P7</dd></div></dl><span class="state">Deleted with its order</span></div>
      </SketchSheet>
      <div class="separation" aria-hidden="true"><svg viewBox="0 0 70 40"><path d="M1 20 L19 20 M29 20 L39 20 M48 20 L53 20" /></svg></div>
      <SketchSheet tone="teal">
        <div class="record"><p class="table-name">products</p><strong class="identity">P7</strong><span class="state">Kept in the catalogue</span></div>
      </SketchSheet>
    </div>
  </section>
  <figcaption>In the first attempt, the arrows follow the line’s two references and all three records remain. In the second, the cascade arrow follows deletion from the order to its line. Deleting that line removes its reference to P7; it does not delete P7. Crossed-out values mark deleted records. Only O12’s first line is shown.</figcaption>
</figure>
<style>
  .constraint-deletion.wide { margin-left:50%; }
  .delete-case { margin:1.7rem 0; }
  .delete-case + .delete-case { border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule-strong); padding-top:1.4rem; }
  .design-figure .outcome { margin:.35rem 0 1rem; color:var(--color-text-secondary); font-size:.85rem; }
  .record-row { display:grid; grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) 4.2rem minmax(0,1.15fr) 4.2rem minmax(0,1fr); gap:.55rem; align-items:center; }
  .record { padding:.25rem 0; }
  .design-figure .table-name { font:500 .82rem/1.4 var(--font-mono); margin:0 0 .6rem; overflow-wrap:anywhere; }
  .identity { display:block; font:500 1.08rem/1.5 var(--font-mono); }
  .state { display:block; margin-top:.7rem; padding-top:.55rem; border-top:1px solid var(--color-rule); font-size:.79rem; }
  dl { margin:.65rem 0 0; font:.74rem/1.6 var(--font-mono); }
  dl > div { display:flex; justify-content:space-between; gap:.6rem; }
  dd { margin:0; }
  .removed .identity,.removed dd { text-decoration:line-through; text-decoration-color:var(--gold); text-decoration-thickness:1.5px; }
  .connection { text-align:center; color:var(--color-text-secondary); }
  .connection span { display:block; font-size:.7rem; margin-top:.25rem; }
  .reference-left :global(svg) { transform:rotate(180deg); }
  .cascade :global(svg) { color:var(--gold); }
  .cascade span { color:var(--gold); font-family:var(--font-mono); }
  .separation svg { width:100%; height:2.5rem; }
  .separation path { fill:none; stroke:var(--color-text-secondary); stroke-width:1; stroke-linecap:round; opacity:.55; }
  @media(max-width:650px) {
    .record-row { grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr); gap:.5rem; max-width:21rem; margin:0 auto; }
    .connection { display:flex; gap:.6rem; align-items:center; margin:.25rem 0 .25rem 1rem; }
    .connection :global(svg) { width:2.5rem; height:2.5rem; transform:rotate(90deg); }
    .reference-left :global(svg) { transform:rotate(-90deg); }
    .connection span { margin:0; }
    .separation { height:1.6rem; margin-left:1.5rem; }
    .separation svg { width:1.5rem; height:1.6rem; transform:rotate(90deg); }
    .record dl { max-width:15rem; }
  }
</style>
